  "_reverification_9sep": "The service was re-queried on 9 September 2026 and every arrival bracket in this file was re-derived from it unchanged: Rasuwagadhi after 08:40 by 08:50, Syabrubesi after 08:50 by 09:00, both Betrawati stations after 09:20 by 09:30, Galchhi after 10:20 by 10:30, Kali Khola after 13:10 by 13:20, Devghat after 14:30 by 14:40, and no front detected at Dhunche. The four destroyed stations were still returning nothing. Retention now reaches back only to the end of August, so this run cannot extend the silence observation past the 2 September date recorded in gauges.json, and it cannot reproduce the pre-event baseline window at all."
